'''MARS PEOPLE''' is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = MARS PEOPLE
|image = E 189.png
|appearance = [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 60¢ - 237¢
}}

==Enemy==
The Metal Slug Defense counterpart of [[Doge]]. It acts worse as a peon due to its long range. It could barely scratch you even with his creepy face.

==Strategy==
It can be killed by almost any unit, but using wave units such as [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Gross Cat]], is a wiser choice for groups of them.

